Z||000000||FieroSTETZ||01-23-2000||12:35 PM||||can someone send me pics, instructions, whatever, about how to replace the coolant temperature sensor on my 86 SE 2m6? i can't seem to find any reference to it in my chilton's manual... thanks much!||||reg||1
Z||000001||David Gamache||01-23-2000||04:40 PM||||Look below the filler neck where the thermostat is located. The sensor is screwed into the front of the lower intake below the EGR solenoid.||||reg||1
Z||000002||David Gamache||01-23-2000||04:42 PM||||a deep socket should work. I do not remember the size off hand.||||reg||1
